Subject: [PATCH] Reference pass 2026-10-17: Pulse composite preset, baseline
 4, output 3 conformed by OpenCV, loop fixes

- inputloop.py: while Deforum renders, write the exact init frames Deforum uses at render size in a TD-readable codec (fixes Movie File In 'Failed to open file'); tick() fills output 3 when ready
- loop player never wraps past the file: a render capped by a short video loops what was rendered
- Tempo > Fit Loop to Init Video sets Loop Length to the most whole bars the video holds
- Example Preset 'Hybrid - Pulse composite (good)' with raw saw schedules (presets can now write <Name>raw; CHOP-linked bases keep theirs)
- baseline 4: legacy colormatch off, perlin 4x4, ControlNet guidance 0.2..0.8
- snapshots skip Force Preprocess / Force Re-render Sweep
- docs/passes: analysis of the pass + its snapshot

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
